  spellName: Chain Whip
  description: Yank the farthest enemy to your feet from up to 12 units away at force
    18, for 0.8x weapon damage. It is hurt again by anything it is dragged through,
    and lands at your side of the field with the whole company in reach of it. The
    archer that hides at the back is the archer this is for.
